    {
      "id": "bridge-representations",
      "type": "page-section",
      "label": "Representations",
      "position": {
        "x": 480,
        "y": 150
      },
      "width": 720,
      "height": 380,
      "data": {
        "title": "Representations",
        "body": "**How is it represented?**\n\nAn import or an export typically renders as a small authority card naming its end, resourceKind and target ref — never the target's own content. It points at what it grants or offers; it doesn't inline it. Collapsed, it shows just enough to answer \"what does this graph have authority over, and in which direction,\" without requiring a fetch of the target to render at all.\n\nAn import or an export is edited on its own card. Which end it is comes from its type, so the editor shows it and does not change it: to turn one into the other, add the other and delete this. An import has a Setup tab (the address, what it takes, what it may do), an export has an Offers tab (the classes and Methods it hands on, and the other kinds of thing, closed until opened), and both have Events and Status tabs.",
        "presentation": {
          "glyph": {
            "kind": "icon",
            "name": "Article"
          },
          "baseLevel": "detail"
        },
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "bridge",
          "updatedAt": 1791592047779,
          "reason": "bridge-reference"
        },
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "fe331a1c-0790-447b-ad05-83ddc1898214"
        },
        "classRef": "tlz://twilite.zone/library/templates/page-template/classes/page-section.node-class.node"
      },
      "inputs": [
        {
          "key": "root",
          "label": "root",
          "type": "any"
        }
      ],
      "ports": [
        {
          "id": "root",
          "key": "root",
          "label": "root",
          "direction": "input",
          "dataType": "any",
          "side": "top",
          "offset": 0.5,
          "position": {
            "side": "top",
            "offset": 0.5
          },
          "metadata": {
            "interface": true,
